116
00:09:30.394 --> 00:09:37.841
NARRATOR: On screen, display a checklist
graphic with three boxes: 'Unique Solution

117
00:09:37.841 --> 00:09:44.047
Verified', 'Constraint Consistency Checked',
'Difficulty Aligned', each with a toggle

118
00:09:44.047 --> 00:09:45.909
